# Root-anchored on purpose: macOS git defaults to core.ignorecase=true, so an
# unanchored `xnumeter` would also swallow Sources/Xnumeter/, and `XnumeterApp`
# would swallow Sources/XnumeterApp/ — the binaries and the source dirs differ
# only in case.
/xnumeter
/XnumeterApp.app/

.DS_Store
.qoder/

# Release staging (make dist output)
/dist/
